# Repository profile

Qarve — an open-hardware modular CNC machine repository following [doqs](https://github.com/refaqt/doqs),
included as a submodule at `doqs/`. Shared agent kit lives in [`.agents/`](../../.agents/)
([refaqt-agents](https://github.com/refaqt/refaqt-agents)). Read `AGENTS.md` first.

- **DOQS** modular open-hardware CNC project (Qarve machine).
- **SysML** in `architecture/` and, when present, `modules/*/architecture/` — authoritative requirements.
- **FreeCAD** 1.1+ with Assembly workbench; parameters via `cad/params/*.csv` and `sync_params.py`.
- **OKH** manifests: `okh.toml` per module; validate with `doqs/scripts/validate_okh.py`.
- Run commands from the **repository root**.
- If `doqs/` or `.agents/` is empty, run `git submodule update --init --recursive`.
- Repo-specific skills: [`.agents-local/skills/`](../../.agents-local/skills/).
- Coding patterns: [`.agents-local/skills/patterns/SKILL.md`](../../.agents-local/skills/patterns/SKILL.md).
